disable-automatic-thread-titles-in-tui

Lane: frontend

FlatPatch: disable-automatic-thread-titles-in-tui

Form: GitDiff

Segment: snapshot

Purpose: Disable automatic conversation naming after ordinary user prompts while preserving explicit naming.

Requires: none

Provides: Disable the automatic title activation policy without changing the native generator, its model selection, or explicit naming entry points.

Boundary: Preserve slash rename, new and fork naming, agent overview naming, generation and cancellation implementations, and independent resume-picker naming.

Verification: Real user-message events start no automatic title request; native generator, slash rename, saved-name priority, progress, and cancellation tests retain their coverage.


